# AI decisioning — TypeSafe AI "Jev" System One model (services/shared/jev/).
# Returns calibrated Choice/Score/Noul answers for ingestion header mapping and
# CTE-type suggestions; optional at runtime (no TYPESAFE_API_KEY -> disabled).
# Pre-1.0 SDK: 0.6 -> 0.7 changed the Score criteria shape and swapped msgspec
# for pydantic, so cap at the next minor and let Dependabot propose the bump.
# Transitives are httpx2 (pydantic's maintained httpx fork; a separate import
# name, coexists with httpx), httpcore2 and truststore — all pure-Python
# wheels, so --require-hashes stays satisfiable on Railway.
typesafe-sdk>=0.7.4,<0.8

